Table full name: HTAN_2.HTAN.SCRNASEQ_LEVEL1_METADATA_CURRENT
Column name: Single_Cell_Isolation_Method Type: TEXT Description: The method by which cells are isolated into individual reaction containers at a single cell resolution (e.g. wells, micro-droplets)
Column name: Valid_Barcodes_Cell_Number Type: TEXT Description: Number
Column name: Id Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier of entity e.g. a96059eb-81af-4b24-ae50-9242c0d8f819
Column name: Sequencing_Platform Type: TEXT Description: A platform is an object aggregate that is the set of instruments and software needed to perform a process [OBI_0000050]. Specific model of the sequencing instrument.
Column name: Median_UMIs_per_Cell_Number Type: TEXT Description: Number
Column name: UMI_Barcode_Offset Type: TEXT Description: Start position of UMI barcode in the sequence. Values: number, 0 for start of read
Column name: Nucleic_Acid_Capture_Days_from_Index Type: TEXT Description: Number of days between sample for single cell assay was received in lab and day of nucleic acid capture part of library construction (in number of days since sample received in lab) [number]. If not applicable please enter 'Not Applicable'
Column name: Dissociation_Method Type: TEXT Description: The tissue dissociation method used for scRNASeq or scATAC-seq assays
Column name: Protocol_Link Type: TEXT Description: Protocols.io ID or DOI link to a free/open protocol resource describing in detail the assay protocol (e.g. surface markers used in Smart-seq, dissociation duration,  lot/batch numbers for key reagents such as primers, sequencing reagent kits, etc.) or the protocol by which the sample was obtained or generated.
Column name: Input_Cells_and_Nuclei Type: TEXT Description: Number of cells and number of nuclei input; entry format: number, number
Column name: File_Format Type: TEXT Description: Format of a file (e.g. txt, csv, fastq, bam, etc.)
Column name: Sequencing_Library_Construction_Days_from_Index Type: TEXT Description: Number of days between sample for assay was received in lab and day of sequencing library construction [number]. If not applicable please enter 'Not Applicable'
Column name: Library_Construction_Method Type: TEXT Description: Process which results in the creation of a library from fragments of DNA using cloning vectors or oligonucleotides with the role of adaptors [OBI_0000711]
Column name: Technical_Replicate_Group Type: TEXT Description: A common term for all files belonging to the same cell or library. Provide a numbering of each library prep batch (can differ from encapsulation and sequencing batch)
Column name: cDNA_Offset Type: TEXT Description: Offset in sequence for cDNA read (in bp): number
Column name: entityId Type: TEXT Description: Synapse ID of entity
Column name: Spike_In Type: TEXT Description: A set of known synthetic RNA molecules with known sequence that are added to the cell lysis mix
Column name: Reverse_Transcription_Primer Type: TEXT Description: An oligo to which new deoxyribonucleotides can be added by DNA polymerase [SO_0000112]. The type of primer used for reverse transcription, e.g. oligo-dT or random primer. This allows users to identify content of the cDNA library input e.g. enriched for mRNA
Column name: Well_Index Type: TEXT Description: Indicate if protein expression (EPCAM/CD45) positive/negative data  is available for each cell in CEL-seq2 assays
Column name: End_Bias Type: TEXT Description: The end of the cDNA molecule that is preferentially sequenced, e.g. 3/5 prime tag/end or the full length transcript
Column name: Cryopreserved_Cells_in_Sample Type: TEXT Description: Indicate if library preparation was based on revived frozen cells.
Column name: HTAN_Center Type: TEXT Description: Name of HTAN Center e.g. HTAN HTAPP
Column name: Empty_Well_Barcode Type: TEXT Description: Unique cell barcode assigned to empty cells used as controls in CEL-seq2 assays.
Column name: Single_Cell_Dissociation_Days_from_Index Type: TEXT Description: Number of days between sample for single cell assay was received in lab and when the sample was dissociated and cells were isolated [number]. If not applicable please enter 'Not Applicable'
Column name: CDS_Release Type: TEXT Description: CDS transfer package in which file was included e.g. v22.6.1.seq
Column name: Manifest_Version Type: NUMBER Description: Latest version of metadata manifest
Column name: File_Size Type: NUMBER Description: Size of file (bucket object) in bytes
Column name: Manifest_Id Type: TEXT Description: Synapse ID of manifest containing file annotation
Column name: Read2 Type: TEXT Description: Read 2 content description
Column name: Nucleic_Acid_Source Type: TEXT Description: The source of the input nucleic molecule
Column name: md5 Type: TEXT Description: md5 hash of file
Column name: HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID Type: TEXT Description: HTAN Biospecimen Identifier (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz) indicating the biospecimen(s) from which these files were derived; multiple parent biospecimen should be comma-separated
Column name: Cell_Barcode_Length Type: TEXT Description: Length of cell barcode read (in bp): number
Column name: Read_Indicator Type: TEXT Description: Indicate if this is Read 1 (R1), Read 2 (R2), Index Reads (I1), or Other
Column name: UMI_Barcode_Length Type: TEXT Description: Length of UMI barcode read (in bp): number
Column name: Library_Preparation_Days_from_Index Type: TEXT Description: Number of days between sample for assay was received in lab and the libraries were prepared for sequencing [number]. If not applicable please enter 'Not Applicable'
Column name: HTAN_Data_File_ID Type: TEXT Description: Self-identifier for this data file - HTAN ID of this file HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz)
Column name: Component Type: TEXT Description: Category of metadata (e.g. Diagnosis, Biospecimen, scRNA-seq Level 1, etc.); provide the same one for all items/rows.
Column name: Feature_Reference_Id Type: TEXT Description: Unique ID for this feature. Must not contain whitespace, quote or comma characters. Each ID must be unique and must not collide with a gene identifier from the transcriptome [https://support.10xgenomics.com/single-cell-gene-expression/software/pipelines/latest/using/feature-bc-analysis#feature-ref]
Column name: Spike_In_Concentration Type: TEXT Description: The final concentration or dilution (for commercial sets) of the spike in mix [PMID:21816910]
Column name: Cell_Barcode_Offset Type: TEXT Description: Offset in sequence for cell barcode read (in bp): number
Column name: cDNA_Length Type: TEXT Description: Length of cDNA read (in bp): number
Column name: Filename Type: TEXT Description: Name of a file
Column name: Data_Release Type: TEXT Description: Inclusion in HTAN Data Release e.g. Release 1.0
Column name: Read1 Type: TEXT Description: Read 1 content description
Column name: Total_Number_of_Input_Cells Type: TEXT Description: Number of cells loaded/placed on plates
